 are filled with strawberry sumac jam and coated in sesame seeds for a sweet and nutty bite.","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/"]}]},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#primaryimage","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cover-tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam.jpg","contentUrl":"https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cover-tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam.jpg","width":800,"height":1200,"caption":"Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://fancifuleats.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Recipes","item":"https://fancifuleats.com/recipes/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Cookies","item":"https://fancifuleats.com/cookies/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/#website","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/","name":"Fanciful Eats","description":"","publisher":{"@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/#organization"},"potentialAction":[{"@type":"SearchAction","target":{"@type":"EntryPoint","urlTemplate":"https://fancifuleats.com/?s={search_term_string}"},"query-input":{"@type":"PropertyValueSpecification","valueRequired":true,"valueName":"search_term_string"}}],"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/#organization","name":"Fanciful Eats","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/#/schema/logo/image/","url":"https://i0.wp.com/fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/cropped-Logo-2.png?fit=512%2C512&ssl=1","contentUrl":"https://i0.wp.com/fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/cropped-Logo-2.png?fit=512%2C512&ssl=1","width":512,"height":512,"caption":"Fanciful Eats"},"image":{"@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/#/schema/logo/image/"},"sameAs":["https://www.instagram.com/fancifuleats/","https://www.pinterest.com/fancifuleats"]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/#/schema/person/e7b137d1929038d432bab69686a0a8a9","name":"Fanciful Eats","sameAs":["https://fancifuleats.com/about/"]},{"@type":"Recipe","name":"Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Celeste"},"description":"These Tahini Thumbprint Cookies are wonderfully tender and filled with sticky strawberry sumac jam. They&#39;re covered in sesame seeds for a touch of nuttiness and they&#39;re perfect for baking when fresh strawberries are in season.","datePublished":"2026-06-18T17:27:33+00:00","image":["https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cover-tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam.jpg","https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cover-tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-500x500.jpg","https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cover-tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-500x375.jpg","https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/cover-tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-480x270.jpg"],"recipeYield":["21","21 cookies"],"prepTime":"PT50M","cookTime":"PT47M","totalTime":"PT157M","recipeIngredient":["454 g strawberries (hulled and chopped)","133 g granulated sugar","2 tsp ground sumac","2 tsp lemon juice","240 g all-purpose flour (spooned and leveled)","20 g cornstarch","1/2 tsp fine sea salt","226 g unsalted butter (softened)","175 g granulated sugar","120 g tahini (well-stirred)","1  large egg (room temperature)","1 tsp pure vanilla extract","72 g white sesame seeds (plus 2 tbsp if needed)"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToSection","name":"Strawberry Sumac Jam:","itemListElement":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Add the strawberries, sugar, sumac, and lemon juice to a small saucepan and stir to combine.","name":"Add the strawberries, sugar, sumac, and lemon juice to a small saucepan and stir to combine.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-0-0"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Place over medium heat and stir occasionally until the liquid starts to release from the strawberries and it comes to a simmer.","name":"Place over medium heat and stir occasionally until the liquid starts to release from the strawberries and it comes to a simmer.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-0-1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Continue simmering for 5 minutes to soften the strawberries. Stir if needed to tamp down any rising bubbles.","name":"Continue simmering for 5 minutes to soften the strawberries. Stir if needed to tamp down any rising bubbles.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-0-2"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Reduce to medium-low heat and use a potato masher or a fork to mash the strawberries into small pieces.","name":"Reduce to medium-low heat and use a potato masher or a fork to mash the strawberries into small pieces.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-0-3"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Continue cooking over medium-low while stirring occasionally until the mixture thickens and gelatinizes, about 15 minutes. While it&#39;s simmering, skim off any foam. You&#39;ll know the jam is done when it falls off a silicone spatula in glossy, jelly-like lumps.","name":"Continue cooking over medium-low while stirring occasionally until the mixture thickens and gelatinizes, about 15 minutes. While it&#39;s simmering, skim off any foam. You&#39;ll know the jam is done when it falls off a silicone spatula in glossy, jelly-like lumps.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-0-4"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Transfer the jam to a heatproof bowl and let it come to room temperature while you make the cookies.","name":"Transfer the jam to a heatproof bowl and let it come to room temperature while you make the cookies.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-0-5"}]},{"@type":"HowToSection","name":"Tahini Thumbprint Cookies:","itemListElement":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"In a medium bowl, whisk together the flour, cornstarch, and salt.","name":"In a medium bowl, whisk together the flour, cornstarch, and salt.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-0"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Add the butter and sugar to a large bowl and use an electric hand mixer to beat on medium speed for 2-3 minutes until pale and creamy.","name":"Add the butter and sugar to a large bowl and use an electric hand mixer to beat on medium speed for 2-3 minutes until pale and creamy.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Add the tahini and mix for 1 minute until well combined and creamy. Mix in the egg and vanilla extract until well combined.","name":"Add the tahini and mix for 1 minute until well combined and creamy. Mix in the egg and vanilla extract until well combined.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-2"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Add the flour mixture and fold until the dough comes together. Don&#39;t overmix. Cover and chill for 1 hour to allow the dough to stiffen up.*","name":"Add the flour mixture and fold until the dough comes together. Don&#39;t overmix. Cover and chill for 1 hour to allow the dough to stiffen up.*","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-3"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"A few minutes before the cookies are done chilling, preheat the oven to 350°F (180°C) and line a large baking sheet with parchment paper. Add the sesame seeds to a small shallow dish.","name":"A few minutes before the cookies are done chilling, preheat the oven to 350°F (180°C) and line a large baking sheet with parchment paper. Add the sesame seeds to a small shallow dish.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-4"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Portion the cookies into 2 tbsp and roll into a ball. Roll the dough ball in the sesame seeds to coat all over then place 2 inches (5 cm) apart on the prepared baking sheet.","name":"Portion the cookies into 2 tbsp and roll into a ball. Roll the dough ball in the sesame seeds to coat all over then place 2 inches (5 cm) apart on the prepared baking sheet.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-5"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Use a half teaspoon measuring spoon to press down in the centers of the dough balls, making a crater.","name":"Use a half teaspoon measuring spoon to press down in the centers of the dough balls, making a crater.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-6"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Bake for 18-20 minutes until the tops are matte and the bottom edges are just starting to brown.","name":"Bake for 18-20 minutes until the tops are matte and the bottom edges are just starting to brown.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-7"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Remove the cookies from the oven and immediately use the same half teaspoon to gently re-shape the indent in the center of the cookies. Use the edges of previously made indent as a guide. Press down gently to prevent the edges from cracking. Cool on the pan for 5 minutes.","name":"Remove the cookies from the oven and immediately use the same half teaspoon to gently re-shape the indent in the center of the cookies. Use the edges of previously made indent as a guide. Press down gently to prevent the edges from cracking. Cool on the pan for 5 minutes.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-8"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Transfer the cookies to a wire rack to cool completely then fill the centers with the cooled strawberry sumac jam.","name":"Transfer the cookies to a wire rack to cool completely then fill the centers with the cooled strawberry sumac jam.","url":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#wprm-recipe-18200-step-1-9"}]}],"recipeCategory":["Cookies"],"recipeCuisine":["American","Middle Eastern"],"keywords":"tahini thumbprint cookies, tahini thumbprint cookies with strawberry sumac jam, thumbprint cookies with strawberry sumac jam","nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","servingSize":"1  cookie","calories":"243 kcal","carbohydrateContent":"28 g","proteinContent":"3 g","fatContent":"14 g","sodiumContent":"63 mg","fiberContent":"1 g","sugarContent":"16 g"},"@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#recipe","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/#article"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/"}]}</script>
