1632,11.4028 L5.0992,11.4028 C4.4722,11.4028 3.9632,10.8948 3.9632,10.2678 C3.9632,9.6408 4.4722,9.1318 5.0992,9.1318 L5.0992,9.1318 Z M16.6304,2.2715 L7.3704,2.2715 L7.3704,4.6845 L16.6304,4.6845 L16.6304,2.2715 Z"></path></g></g></g></svg></span> Print Recipe</a></div><input class="jpibfi" type="hidden">
<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<p class="has-text-align-center"><em>These <strong>Tahini Thumbprint Cookies </strong>are wonderfully tender and filled with sticky strawberry<strong> </strong>sumac jam. They&#8217;re covered in sesame seeds for a touch of nuttiness and they&#8217;re perfect for baking when fresh strawberries are in season.</em></p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%201800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam." class="wp-image-18366" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam" data-jpibfi-src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9.jpg 1200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-200x300.jpg 200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-900x1350.jpg 900w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-360x540.jpg 360w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-180x270.jpg 180w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-150x225.jpg 150w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9.jpg" alt="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam." class="wp-image-18366" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam" data-jpibfi-src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9.jpg" srcset="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9.jpg 1200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-200x300.jpg 200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-900x1350.jpg 900w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-360x540.jpg 360w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-180x270.jpg 180w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-9-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<p>These tahini thumbprint cookies are very reminiscent of a peanut butter and jelly sandwich. The tahini and sesame seeds add a nutty flavor while the strawberry sumac jam adds a layer of fruity sweetness. </p>



<p>When testing these cookies, we tried two different methods for when to add the jam. Ultimately, we landed on adding it after baking the cookies because they looked a lot better than the alternative. While adding the jam before baking didn&#8217;t require us to make an extra indent in the cookies, it bubbled in a way that made the final result look lackluster. So if you&#8217;re wondering why we didn&#8217;t just fill them beforehand, that&#8217;s why.</p>



<p>To store these cookies, we keep them in the fridge because they not only last longer, but we find that they taste better when they&#8217;re cold. Plus, the texture is nice and tender, almost like a shortbread cookie. These are great by themselves but we image they&#8217;d be even better with a nice cup of black tea!</p>
</div></div>
</div></div>


