<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<h2 id="ingredient-notes-and-substitutions"   class="wp-block-heading" >Ingredient Notes and Substitutions</h2>



<p><em>Find the full list of ingredients, measurements, and instructions in the recipe card below!</em></p>



<ul style="background-color:#ebe0dd" class="wp-block-list has-background">
<li><strong>Strawberries: </strong>We use fresh strawberries since we&#8217;re cutting them into chunks.</li>



<li><strong>Ground Sumac:</strong> This adds an earthy fruity flavor to the jam.</li>



<li><strong>Cornstarch:</strong> This tenderizes the cookies, making them nice and soft.</li>



<li><strong>Tahini:</strong> Make sure your tahini is well-stirred before using it. Doing this ensures that there are no lumps in your cookie dough.</li>
</ul>
</div></div>



