.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2.jpg" alt="Strawberry sumac jam in a saucepan." class="wp-image-18359" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam" data-jpibfi-src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2.jpg" srcset="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2.jpg 1200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-200x300.jpg 200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-900x1350.jpg 900w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-360x540.jpg 360w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-180x270.jpg 180w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-2-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p><strong>2. Cook the strawberry jam.</strong> Mash the strawberries with a potato masher or forks then cook on medium-low heat while stirring occasionally. You&#8217;ll know the jam is done when it looks glossy and gelatinous.</p>
</div>
</div>



