wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4.jpg" alt="Cookie dough batter in a bowl." class="wp-image-18361" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam" data-jpibfi-src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4.jpg" srcset="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4.jpg 1200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-200x300.jpg 200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-900x1350.jpg 900w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-360x540.jpg 360w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-180x270.jpg 180w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-4-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p><strong>4. Add the dry ingredients then chill the dough.</strong> Fold the flour mixture into the wet ingredients then chill the dough for at least 1 hour to stiffen up. You should be able to easily shape the dough without it being sticky.</p>
</div>
</div>



