="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5.jpg" alt="Sesame rolled cookie dough balls on a lined baking sheet." class="wp-image-18362" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam" data-jpibfi-src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5.jpg" srcset="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5.jpg 1200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-200x300.jpg 200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-900x1350.jpg 900w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-360x540.jpg 360w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-180x270.jpg 180w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-5-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p><strong>5. Roll in sesame seeds.</strong> Portion the dough into 2 tbsp dough balls then roll in the sesame seeds before placing them on the baking sheet.</p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
