800" src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8.jpg" alt="A hand spooning strawberry sumac jam into the center of a cookie." class="wp-image-18365" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://fancifuleats.com/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam/" data-jpibfi-post-title="Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam" data-jpibfi-src="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8.jpg" srcset="https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8.jpg 1200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-200x300.jpg 200w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-900x1350.jpg 900w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-360x540.jpg 360w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-180x270.jpg 180w, https://fancifuleats.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam-8-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></figure>



<p><strong>8. Fill the centers with jam.</strong> Spoon the strawberry sumac jam into the wells of each cookie.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-group feast-top-tip"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<h2 id="tips-for-these-tahini-thumbprint-cookies"   class="wp-block-heading" >Tips for These Tahini Thumbprint Cookies</h2>



<ul style="background-color:#ebe0dd" class="wp-block-list has-background">
<li><strong>Use a <a href="https://www.amazon.com/OXO-Grips-Stainless-Pull-Out-Display/dp/B079D9B82W/ref=asc_df_B079D9B82W?mcid=108cfc2f2591394e816546d45aec96c4&amp;hvocijid=17547983325709632316-B079D9B82W-&amp;hvexpln=73&amp;tag=hyprod-20&amp;linkCode=df0&amp;hvadid=721245378154&amp;hvpos=&amp;hvnetw=g&amp;hvrand=17547983325709632316&amp;hvpone=&amp;hvptwo=&amp;hvqmt=&amp;hvdev=c&amp;hvdvcmdl=&amp;hvlocint=&amp;hvlocphy=9028226&amp;hvtargid=pla-2281435182698&amp;psc=1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">kitchen scale</a>.</strong> It&#8217;s too easy to over or under measure things like flour and sugar which is why we always recommend using a kitchen scale/grams when baking. That way you&#8217;ll end up with more consistent results.</li>



<li><strong>Chill the dough longer if needed.</strong> If the dough starts to stick to your hands, chill it for at least another 30 minutes. A sticky dough makes things messier and you&#8217;ll end up using a lot more sesame seeds.</li>
</ul>
</div></div>
</div></div>



