<h2 id="tahini-thumbprint-cookies-with-strawberry-sumac-jam"   class="wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-uppercase">Tahini Thumbprint Cookies with Strawberry Sumac Jam</h2>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>
<div class="wprm-recipe-block-container wprm-recipe-block-container-inline wprm-block-text-normal wprm-recipe-author-container" style=""><span class="wprm-recipe-details-label wprm-block-text-bold wprm-recipe-author-label">Author: </span><span class="wprm-recipe-details wprm-recipe-author wprm-block-text-normal"><a href="https://fancifuleats.com/about/" target="_self">Celeste</a></span></div>
<div class="wprm-spacer"></div>

<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;"><em>These </em><em><strong>Tahini Thumbprint Cookies </strong></em><em>are wonderfully tender and filled with sticky strawberry</em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>sumac jam. They&#39;re covered in sesame seeds for a touch of nuttiness and they&#39;re perfect for baking when fresh strawberries are in season.</em></span></div>
